OneDigital, a national insurance brokerage and financial services provider, announced the addition of private market investment options to its personalized portfolio program for 401(k) plan sponsors. The program will incorporate private equity, private credit and opportunistic investments from Blackstone, Apollo Global Management and Ares Management.&nbsp;

